### GET /api/events/{topic}/summary
# Counts for one resource. Only for topics that are approved + public, otherwise 404.
# append -> { "mode": "append", "total": n }
# toggle -> { "mode": "toggle", "counts": { "like": n }, "mine": ["like"] }

@topic = reactions

### By URL, with the visitor's own reactions in `mine`
GET {{publicUrl}}/api/events/{{topic}}/summary?resourceUrl=/blog/hello&visitorId=visitor-1

### By id, anonymous (`mine` is empty)
GET {{publicUrl}}/api/events/{{topic}}/summary?resourceId=post:123

### Invalid topic name -> 400
GET {{publicUrl}}/api/events/Not-Valid!/summary?resourceUrl=/blog/hello
### New Request
GET 
